# Zatroz — content and design

Use when writing copy, placing brand assets, or building visual UI.

- **Colours (direction):** orange `#FF3B10`, charcoal `#111111`, warm white `#F7F5F2`. Use **dark text** on the orange primary button.
- After Step 11 creates design tokens, use those tokens instead of inventing new ones.
- Use the **real approved logo** only; do not redraw or invent brand marks.
- Do **not** invent client logos, testimonials, awards, statistics, or delivery promises. Mark unknowns as TODO.
- Do **not** publish package prices until founders confirm stable inclusions/exclusions.
- Keep routes and CTAs consistent with `docs/planning/03-sitemap.md`, `navigation-spec.md`, and `visitor-journeys.md` (primary CTA: Start a project → Contact).
- Content inventory and assets: `docs/content/`.
